  "mmd": "%% Figure 16-1 — Scope attenuation before action admission\n%% A human delegates a read-and-request workflow through an agent and refund service to the Gateway enforcement point. The Gateway denies refund execution because the effective permission is narrower than the required action scope.\nsequenceDiagram\n participant H as Human\n participant A as Agent\n participant S as Refund service\n participant P as Gateway PEP\n participant T as Refund tool\n H->>A: delegates read/request\n A->>S: delegates request\n S->>P: requests action\n Note over P: evaluates scope\n P-->>S: denies execution\n Note over T: Not invoked\n Note over H,P: Effective refund:request; required refund:execute\n",
  "alt": "A human delegates a read-and-request workflow through an agent and refund service to the Gateway enforcement point. The Gateway denies refund execution because the effective permission is narrower than the required action scope."
}
